            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">polymer electrolyte membrane (PEM) fuel cell for stationary cogeneration. Performance, stack lifetime and catalyst use according to expected future values for a serial product. Operation with connection to low pressure gas network. Electrical efficiency 32%, total efficiency 87%.\n\n# Included processes\nThe module includes the most important materials used for production, the energy needed for production, planning and engineering. Also included is the transport of the raw materials the installation on the site.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
